### 1. Send an Agent Mode Task (Autonomous Reason + Act with Sandbox Execution)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/task
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Build a real-time reactive counter application with dark mode in index.html",
  "mode": "agent"
}

### 2. Send an Ask Mode Request (Conversational Architecture Q&A)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/task
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Explain how to architect a secure Docker sandbox with memory and CPU cgroups",
  "mode": "ask"
}

### 3. Connect to Server-Sent Events (SSE) Stream
GET http://localhost:8080/api/agent/events
Accept: text/event-stream

### 4. Fetch User Profile
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user

### 5. Fetch GitHub Repositories for Wiki Tab
GET http://localhost:8080/api/git/repos

### 6. Fetch Git Workspace Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/git/status

### 7. Fetch Git Unified Diff
GET http://localhost:8080/api/git/diff

### 8. Fetch Docker Sandbox Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/docker/status

### 9. Fetch Workspace File Tree
GET http://localhost:8080/api/workspace/files

### 10. Fetch Specific File Content
GET http://localhost:8080/api/workspace/file-content?path=index.html

### 11. Fetch Dynamic Skills Library
GET http://localhost:8080/api/skills

### 12. Create / Update Custom Domain Skill
POST http://localhost:8080/api/skills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "FastAPI Microservices",
  "description": "FastAPI async endpoints with Pydantic v2 validation",
  "icon": "⚡",
  "tags": ["fastapi", "pydantic", "async", "python"],
  "enabled": true,
  "custom": true,
  "content": "# FastAPI Guidelines\n* Use async def for I/O operations\n* Define response_model schemas"
}

### 13. Toggle Skill On/Off
POST http://localhost:8080/api/skills/web/toggle

### 14. Fetch Agent Personas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/personas

### 15. Save Custom Persona Directive
POST http://localhost:8080/api/personas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "architect",
  "name": "Architect Agent",
  "role": "ARCHITECT",
  "icon": "📐",
  "color": "purple",
  "description": "Analyzes project requirements and creates structural blueprints.",
  "systemPrompt": "You are the Lead Systems Architect. Break down requirements into modular components.",
  "temperature": 0.35,
  "active": true
}